erator detection & auto repair\n\nKiller proximity detection & escape routing\n\nDeath handling & bot reset\n\nAuto teleport every 20 minutes (anti-AFK)\n\n⚡ Movement & Stamina\nAuto sprint logic: Detects stamina and toggles sprinting via LeftShift\n\nInfinite Stamina: Disables stamina drain completely\n\nCamera CFrame tweaks during interactions\n\n🔪 Killer Tools\nKnife Throw Simulation: Simulated legit knife throws using raycasts\n\nInstant Kill Button: Instantly teleports and kills closest player as murderer\n\nKill Aura: Automatically kills nearby players within 7 studs range\n\nWeapon Equip Handler: Equips knife if not already equipped\n\n🧠 ESP (Wallhack)\nPlayer ESP: Green highlights on other players\n\nGenerator ESP: Yellow highlights on generators\n\nItem ESP: Cyan highlights on tools and medkits\n\nKiller ESP: Red glow and outline on killer character\n\n🛠️ User Interface (Luna UI)\nModern GUI with tabs: Automation, Killer, ESP\n\nCustom Notifications using Luna’s built-in notifier\n\nConfig system support (optional folder structure)\n\n🧪 Other Functionalities\nToggle controls for all systems\n\nReal-time ESP updating\n\nHighlight cleanup between toggles\n\nFailsafe: retries on path/timeouts during generator fixing\n\nCustomizable Sprinting Threshold","tags":["Forsaken","UPD Forsaken","Autofarm"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/wJGMw8CJke","keyLink":"https://ads.luarmor.net/get_key?for=Forsaken-bhZOhhmXPxxw","owner":{"_id":"6821811f91ae140e8fb81f23","username":"whoisthisugly","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8534589e8a2faa4f933a2f312bf24def03c50f1a8e6d4a37e8b201a0a97c3986.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6821811f91ae140e8fb81f23-1749666494907.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6821811f91ae140e8fb81f23","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/8534589e8a2faa4f933a2f312bf24def03c50f1a8e6d4a37e8b201a0a97c3986.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6821811f91ae140e8fb81f23-1749666494907.png"}},"revie